docs\progress\logs\20260624-221203_execute-P001.log:8801:I need to look into how the arrow keys work for navigating around a table cell. It’s interesting how these small keys can significantly affect user experience. I’m curious about whether they allow for easy movement between cells and if there are specific shortcuts or settings I should check. This might be straightforward, but I want to make sure I have a clear understanding before explaining it to the user! Let's look into this further.
